      "sourceTextSha256": "8b06dd8f60401d41f7145ed770a44016d2cc346397900b5801e9f02e9d7d2e62",
      "text": "After breakfast, set out by motorboat on the Preguiças River at 08:30.\n\nThe first stop is Vassouras, known as Little Lençóis. Here you can drink coconut water, take photos with the monkeys and visit a fishing village.\n\nThen climb the 160 steps to the Preguiças Lighthouse. From the top, you can see the dunes, the river, the ocean and the dense vegetation.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-19a4d5cc14ef",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
    },
