      "sourceTextSha256": "49b5ca8e268a110e771fb7337299321c82fba45caf920ff88be24fc94225a7b6",
      "text": "After breakfast, head to Atins Lagoon.\n\nOn the way back, stop for lunch at the Louise restaurant, where you can try the prawns. Lunch and prawns are not included in the tour price.\n\nAfter lunch, transfer to São Luís.",
